    "detailed_description": "Lethal Pongbat is a game inspired by the classic Mortal Pongbat game for Macintosh, but includes some new features as well.<br><br><strong>PONG WITH LASERS</strong><br><br>Each paddle is equipped with a powerful beam that can be used to shoot the opposing paddle to bits. Use the beam wisely as it needs time to recharge.<br><br><strong>NOW YOU'RE PLAYING WITH POWER</strong><br><br>Several power-ups are available through random spawning blocks. Hit a block with a ball to activate a power-up. Power-ups can have a variety of effects, including growing the beam or repairing damage of your paddle.<br><br><strong>PLAY AGAINST CPU OR HUMANS</strong><br><br>Play against a human or the computer, the choice is yours. Play against other humans behind the same computer or over a local area network.<br><br><strong>GAMEPADS SUPPORTED</strong><br><br>Just connect a gamepad and be ready to go.",
